 is abducted by the aliens  back to brenner's life he works at the  home of lieutenant colonel fan patton  and her son matthew van patten who tells  brenner that his mother is going through  a divorce  after finishing his work he comes to  violet's room to ask for payment  apparently he hears violet crying in the  closet  therefore he comes in and immediately  comforts her by listening to her current  situation because he gets carried away  brenner wants to kiss her but sadly  violet refuses shortly after he gets a  call from cooper asking him to go to the  white house  on his way brenner reunites with violet  who turns out to have the same  destination as him  soon cooper shows him the recording of  galaga aliens attacking the us military  base earlier and turning it into pixels  cooper in disbelief asks him to explain  what happened  however his explanation is not accepted  by the security council because he is  just an ordinary civilian as a result he  drives his van home  suddenly a young man calls his name from  the back it turns out that the man is  ludlow his childhood friend  he then brings brenner back to his house  where he says that the alien used the  classic video game designs to attack he  shows a footage taken from a television  show in the 1980s which contains the  alien's plan to invade earth thus they  show the footage to cooper afterwards  brenner determines that aliens have  misinterpreted the video cassette in the  time capsule as a declaration of war  consequently they will attack with  technology based on the video games  challenging earth to a battle where if  the aliens win three rounds they will  conquer earth  furthermore ludlow also says that the  next attack will happen in india  unfortunately cooper refuses to warn  india of something that is not certain  to happen  sure enough the aliens attack as  arkanoid paddles which sling the balls  of light to destroy the taj mahal  they also abduct a bystander as a bonus  later brenner and ludlow are taken to  the armaments department led by violet  she shows them that the pixels can be  disabled by light cannons developed by  her they are also asked to train navy  seals to fight back against the aliens  by showing them how to play these old  games the following day cooper is with  his wife jane at a bakery when suddenly  his assistant comes and tells him that  the next attack will be in london  therefore all of the soldiers  immediately go to the park which is  predicted to be attacked by the aliens  at night it is revealed that the aliens  attack in the form of the video game  galaga centipede brenner tells the navy  seals to shoot for the head and  anticipate the unpredictable pattern but  the soldiers still have no clue about it  because of that brenner and ludlow are  able to step in and shoot them down  the final centipede bursts into town and  nearly devours a little boy but luckily  brenner manages to destroy the final  centipede when they are celebrating  their victory the aliens send a message  using the fantasy guys to congratulate  earth they also send a trophy in the  form of a dog from duck hunt besides  that the aliens remind them that they  are still leading two to one and the  next challenge will be even more  difficult than before knowing this they  agreed to find someone else to help them  the group decides to retrieve eddie from  a prison sentence for fraud he makes  self-serving demands in exchange for his  help some of which cooper finally agrees  to a few moments later violet receives  an information that the next game will  happen in new york city the team goes  there immediately and discovers that the  next boss is pac-man which they must  participate as the ghosts against it  therefore violet presents the team with  four mini cooper cars which were already  armed to defeat pac-man they are also  assisted with toru iwatani the creator  of pac-man they head to the city where  pac-man is chomping through everything  after that toru tries to confront the  pac-man but his hand gets bitten instead  brenner ludlow and eddie continue to  chase after pac-man eddie manages to hit  the first pac-man after violet notices  him moving at supersonic speeds around  the board at one point the second pacman  eats a power pellet giving it a 10  seconds to be able to eat the ghosts  consequently it chomps ludlow's car as  he jumps out from the car just at the  right time eddie hits the second pac-man  again to save ludlow the third pac-man  causes eddie to fall into the river  leaving brenner as the final ghost  unluckily it finds another power palette  near the parking garage brenner  immediately comes down and drives  backwards through the parking garage  on the count of ten he is able to beat  the last pac-man who is about to eat him  after winning their second game they get  cubered as a winning trophy  the next day brenner asks violet to be  his date in the celebration party which  she accepts when he spends time with her  at the party the aliens suddenly send  another message declaring the challenge  for the planet has been forfeited  because someone cheated outside matthew  discovers eddie used a speed sheet in  his classes which allowed him to beat  pac-man beforehand  it also explains how he beat brenner in  donkey kong a long time ago afterwards  eddie flees while maddie is abducted by  the aliens  back to the house hubert tells them that  the aliens leave peacefully until they  felt threatened by the time capsule  because they did not know it was just a  video game  subsequently the group realizes that  they have to go to the spaceship and  stop the aliens the next morning the  aliens launch a massive attack in  washington dc using both good and bad  characters from classic video games  cooper finally joins the team to get  into the spaceship while ludlow stays to  fight meanwhile an alien takes the form  of lady lisa a character on whom ludlow  had a crush since childhood he  eventually persuades lady lisa to choose  love and side with the humans eddie also  returns to the fight because he wants to  make amends  brenner violet cooper and cubert are  summoned to the alien's mothership where  they face the alien leader in the form  of donkey kong starting from the lowest  level with the alien's captives at the  top level  as the group dodges barrels and  fireballs brenner is losing hope until  maddie tells brenner that eddie was  cheating on him many years ago causing  him to realize that he should have been  the winner at that time with his  confidence drastically increased brenner  defeats the donkey kong this causes the  alien's characters to self-destruct  including lady lisa which causes ludlow  to feel sad  the team is hailed as heroes by cooper  himself and a peace agreement is reached  with the aliens  in the meantime eddie apologizes to  brenner for cheating and admits that he  is the best in the world although ludlow  is saddened that lady lisa was gone  hubert suddenly transforms its likeness  to lady lisa  lastly brenner and violet become a  couple while eddie gets to meet serena  williams and martha stewart like he  always dreamed of the aliens also  restored toru's hand before their  departure  a year later lady lisa and ludlow marry  and have cuber children  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications  and leave a like to help the channel out  thank you for watching
 

